{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102132","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102132/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102132/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102132/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102132","id":2816305959,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6JQr02","number":102132,"title":"Optimize `Font` calculations by avoiding unnecessary copy-on-write.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","number":20,"title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-01-28T17:24:08Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T21:00:17Z","closed_at":"2025-02-07T20:56:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102132","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102132","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102132.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102132.patch","merged_at":"2025-02-07T20:56:37Z"},"body":"- *Production edit: Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102129.*\r\n\r\nI profiled scrolling across 4000 `Node` entries in the scene tree.\r\nI was able to improve its performance by 20% by avoiding unnecessary copy-on-write calls.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n`Array[i]` has a const and a non-const implementation.\r\nWhen a mutable instance is available, the non-const implementation is always chosen. This version implies a fork of the `CowData` (copy-on-write). \r\n`Font` has a `mutable TypedArray<RID> rids` - because it is `mutable`, it is always non-const. For this reason, it will always cause forks on `operator[]` access.\r\nThe `.get` function does not have a non-const implementation. As such, it does not cause forks.\r\n\r\n## Profiler\r\nI profiled the scrolling across 4000 items in the scene tree.\r\nI used Apple Instruments' CPU profiler and inverted the call tree.\r\n\r\nBefore (after this PR, this entry is completely gone).\r\n```\r\n1.50 Gc  22,8 %\t  CowData<Variant>::_copy_on_write()\r\n1.48 Gc  22,4 %\t   CowData<Variant>::ptrw()\r\n1.48 Gc  22,4 %\t    VectorWriteProxy<Variant>::operator[](long long)\r\n1.48 Gc  22,4 %\t     Array::operator[](int)\r\n1.48 Gc  22,4 %\t      Font::get_height(int) const\r\n1.48 Gc  22,4 %\t       Tree::compute_item_height(TreeItem*) const\r\n917.26 Mc  13,9 %\t        Tree::get_item_height(TreeItem*) const\r\n917.26 Mc  13,9 %\t         Tree::get_item_height(TreeItem*) const\r\n917.26 Mc  13,9 %\t          Tree::get_internal_min_size() const\r\n917.26 Mc  13,9 %\t           Tree::update_scrollbars()\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Caveats\r\nIt would be better to eliminate the non-const `operator[]` entirely, and replace it with a `Vector.write`-like construct, such that `CoW` must be intentional. This change would avoid this kind of problem in the future.\r\nHowever, that will require quite a lot more work.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102132/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102132/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}